	(text "design with no timer from youtube\nhttps://youtu.be/kIJqzkRe4do?si=QA2-CuvZMmrfAoZy\ndid not know how to set up the square wave input voltage\nhowever, learned how to run KiCad simulator\nsimulation requires symbols to have simulation models uploaded into their smybol properties \nor to be picked from the default symbol library"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 67.31 50.038 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "9b946040-947d-47c6-86e2-d2fef556ba1c")
	)
	(text_box "basic ahh s&h\nto answer lucas question on what makes it accurate:\nthe capacitor and FET selection/sourcing\n\nreducing volume of input voltage would also improve accuracy but we would also need to amplify the output\n\na smaller capacitor would help b/c it is charged/discharged more quickly but it would leak more than a large one due to it being nonideal \nleading to voltage droop and an unsteady output during the hold"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 83.82 112.014 0)
